# Component file names

- One folder per component under `ui/`. Folder and implementation file are kebab-case of the
  export: `Button` → `button/button.tsx`, `CustomButton` → `custom-button/custom-button.tsx`.
  Never `Button.tsx`, `CustomButton.tsx`, or `itemCard.tsx`.
- Same stem for colocated test and stories: `custom-button.test.tsx`, `custom-button.stories.tsx`.
- `styles.ts`, `index.ts`, `types.ts`, and `constants.ts` keep those exact names.
- The named export is PascalCase (`export const CustomButton`). Import the folder through
  `index.ts`, never the `.tsx` file.
- Nested `ui/` children follow the same rule.

For scaffolding the folder, load the `react-component` skill.
